span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└──────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                           │ Current Metadata Pointer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌──────────────────────────▼─────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│                 Table Metadata File                    │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│            Schema • Partitions • Snapshots             │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└──────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                           │ Manifest List</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌──────────────────────────▼─────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│                 Manifest Files (.avro)                 │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│         Data file pointers, column statistics          │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└──────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                           │ Data Files</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌──────────────────────────▼─────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│            Parquet Data Files on Amazon S3             │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><h2 id=\"core-architectural-advantages\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Core Architectural Advantages</span><a href=\"#core-architectural-advantages\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><h3 id=\"1-hidden-partitioning-partition-evolution\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>1. Hidden Partitioning &amp; Partition Evolution</span><a href=\"#1-hidden-partitioning-partition-evolution\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">In legacy data lakes, users must understand the exact directory hierarchy (e.g. <code>year=2026/month=03/day=24</code>) to avoid full table scans. If business requirements change from daily to hourly partitioning, past data had to be completely migrated.</p><p class=\"text-pretty\">With Iceberg:</p><ul>\n<li>Partitioning transforms (e.g. <code>days(event_timestamp)</code>) are stored in metadata.</li>\n<li>Queries against <code>WHERE event_timestamp &gt;= '2026-03-01'</code> automatically prune files without requiring users to write error-prone partition column clauses.</li>\n<li>Schema and partition layout can evolve over time without rewriting historical Parquet files.</li>\n</ul><h3 id=\"2-high-throughput-streaming-ingestion-with-spark\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>2. High-Throughput Streaming Ingestion with Spark</span><a href=\"#2-high-throughput-streaming-ingestion-with-spark\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">Streaming transactions directly into Iceberg using Spark Structured Streaming provides exact-once semantics with automated checkpointing:</p><div class=\"code-block relative my-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm group\">\n<div class=\"code-block-header flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">python</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded transition-colors\" data-code=\"from%20pyspark.sql%20import%20SparkSession%0A%0Aspark%20%3D%20SparkSession.builder%20%5C%0A%20%20%20%20.appName(%22IcebergStreamIngestion%22)%20%5C%0A%20%20%20%20.config(%22spark.sql.extensions%22%2C%20%22org.apache.iceberg.spark.extensions.IcebergSparkSessionExtensions%22)%20%5C%0A%20%20%20%20.config(%22spark.sql.catalog.glue_catalog%22%2C%20%22org.apache.iceberg.spark.SparkCatalog%22)%20%5C%0A%20%20%20%20.getOrCreate()%0A%0A%23%20Micro-batch%20stream%20appending%20into%20Iceberg%20table%0Aquery%20%3D%20streaming_df.writeStream%20%5C%0A%20%20%20%20.format(%22iceberg%22)%20%5C%0A%20%20%20%20.outputMode(%22append%22)%20%5C%0A%20%20%20%20.trigger(processingTime%3D%221%20minute%22)%20%5C%0A%20%20%20%20.option(%22checkpointLocation%22%2C%20%22s3%3A%2F%2Flakehouse-checkpoints%2Fevents_silver%22)%20%5C%0A%20%20%20%20.toTable(%22glue_catalog.analytics.events_silver%22)\" data-i18n-aria=\"copyCode\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span data-copy-label>Copy</span></button>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark shiki-pre\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyspark.sql </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SparkSession</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;-