on\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">High-frequency streaming creates numerous small files that degrade query latency. A robust lakehouse requires automated maintenance routines:</p><ol>\n<li><strong>Bin-Packing Compaction</strong>: Run <code>rewrite_data_files</code> periodically to coalesce micro-batch Parquet files into target 512MB-1GB blocks.</li>\n<li><strong>Snapshot Expiration</strong>: Expire historical snapshots older than retention policies (e.g. 7 days) to reclaim S3 storage.</li>\n<li><strong>Remove Orphan Files</strong>: Clean up unreferenced files from interrupted tasks.</li>\n</ol><div class=\"code-block relative my-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm group\">\n<div class=\"code-block-header flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">sql</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded transition-colors\" data-code=\"--%20Iceberg%20maintenance%20via%20Spark%20SQL%0ACALL%20glue_catalog.system.rewrite_data_files(%0A%20%20table%20%3D%3E%20'analytics.events_silver'%2C%0A%20%20strategy%20%3D%3E%20'binpack'%2C%0A%20%20options%20%3D%3E%20map('target-file-size-bytes'%2C%20'536870912')%0A)%3B\" data-i18n-aria=\"copyCode\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span data-copy-label>Copy</span></button>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark shiki-pre\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Ic