us-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><ul>\n<li><strong>90%+ Reduction in Listing Latency</strong>: Metadata queries return instantly via manifest files.</li>\n<li><strong>Predictable S3 Storage Cost</strong>: Scheduled compaction and snapshot pruning eliminate silent data inflation.</li>\n<li><strong>Reliable Data Quality</strong>: Downstream analytical consumers query consistent snapshots without locking writers.</li>\n</ul>"}
